    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>万代法务散德行；随礼随出大暴击&nbsp;|&nbsp;走神大师230</span><br><br><span>参与者：Sin、魔魔、化身伊陆</span><br><br><span>OP：うぬぼれ刑事のテーマ〜2010</span><br><span>ED：家出&nbsp;(Cover)</span><br><br><span>国庆结束后，大师群聊的魔魔和Sin决定分享一些在WF展和工作中的见闻与八卦，本以为是一次常规的分享，没想到开局因睡眠不足而爆困的化身伊陆越听越精神，甚至三个人笑成一团，到底怎么回事？快在本期节目中寻找答案吧！</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a>&nbsp;从游戏聊起&nbsp;之&nbsp;光环:战役进化&nbsp;</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a>&nbsp;从游戏聊起&nbsp;之&nbsp;沙罗周期</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a>&nbsp;从游戏聊起&nbsp;之&nbsp;鬼武者:剑之道</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a>&nbsp;从游戏聊起&nbsp;之&nbsp;控制:共振</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a>&nbsp;从游戏聊起&nbsp;之&nbsp;王牌空战8</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">26:45</a>&nbsp;从游戏聊起&nbsp;之&nbsp;刺客信条:影</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1757">29:17</a>&nbsp;艾希续作众筹太成功，制作人疯了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a>&nbsp;游戏美术激情开麦：可不可以多点热爱！？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">48:42</a>&nbsp;展开讨论：很多人说现在的游戏UI没特色了，专业人士怎么看？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3994">66:34</a>&nbsp;WF展见闻录：爱，伪娘，机器人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6896">114:56</a>&nbsp;朋友婚礼随份子，居然随出了代际伤害！？</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm9Z-iYlUjumiywP_lnLNqNMMCf7.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
