    <title>双厨狂喜！游戏联动的神与鬼 | 走神大师229</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ada140397726cd467563150</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ada140397726cd467563150</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>双厨狂喜！游戏联动的神与鬼&nbsp;|&nbsp;走神大师229</span><br><br><span>参与者：九尺獠牙、时雨、Lost、化身伊陆</span><br><br><span>OP：うぬぼれ刑事のテーマ〜2010</span><br><span>ED：君は薔薇より美しい(Cover)</span><br><br><span>哪些游戏联动让我们印象深刻？哪些游戏联动转眼就忘？在本期节目中，我们将从“还原度、适应性、营养度”三个维度，细品几个让我们印象深刻的游戏联动案例。</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a>&nbsp;《赛博朋克:边缘行者》在那个世界的故事…</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a>&nbsp;《堡垒之夜》里可真是什么都有</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a>&nbsp;育碧能将各种IP拉到自己世界观里</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2123">35:23</a>&nbsp;贝希摩斯真是太强了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2630">43:50</a>&nbsp;《黎明杀机》里的联动地图居然能…！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4035">67:15</a>&nbsp;《杀手》与演员们的联动</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4483">74:43</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;世界上把IP大融合做到终极的《任天堂明星大乱斗终极版》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4886">81:26</a>&nbsp;第一个反面案例——《人中北斗》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5228">87:08</a>&nbsp;街霸X铁拳也太欺负人了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5428">90:28</a>&nbsp;自由讨论：什么样的联动算好，什么样的算坏？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5643">94:03</a>&nbsp;谈到细胞分裂男主变成0，罗斯特疯了。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6417">106:57</a>&nbsp;梦游大师：你希望看到哪两个游戏IP联动？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6970">116:10</a>&nbsp;为什么日厂角色这么难联动？听专业人士来揭秘！</span><br></p>]]></description>
