  <item>
    <title>【大师群聊】他急了！游戏玩家VS低情商发言！ | 走神大师228</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad4f8e70e4e410a05becb18</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad4f8e70e4e410a05becb18</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【大师群聊】他急了！游戏玩家VS低情商发言！&nbsp;|&nbsp;走神大师228</span><br><br><span>参与者：魔魔、时雨、Sin、Lost、化身伊陆</span><br><br><span>OP：うぬぼれ刑事のテーマ〜2010</span><br><span>ED：我倒也不是嫉妒啦(Cover)</span><br><br><span>兴冲冲地分享着自己喜欢的游戏，却被对方一句话说得破了防。这样的经历你是否有过？</span><br><span>在本期节目中，我们要将这种体验彻底解构，每个人都将正面迎击那些低情商发言，将它们变成游戏的一部分。</span><br><span>让暴风雨来得更猛烈些吧，我们对游戏的爱，是无穷的！</span><br><strong><span>（本节目内可能包含令人不适的内容，所有攻击性的语言都只限定在本期节目及参与者之内，且不代表参与者们的真实观点。）</span></strong><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a>&nbsp;前言·规则介绍</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">04:07</a>&nbsp;“生死状”环节，是的！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a>&nbsp;“唉，又是类魂”，他把我逗笑了。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a>&nbsp;作为一个RPG玩家，我简直将角色扮演做到了极致！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2195">36:35</a>&nbsp;好不容易能串了，结果只有我在串！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2693">44:53</a>&nbsp;恐怖游戏玩家与雷霆嘉豪</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3411">56:51</a>&nbsp;从这一刻开始，阿罗解放了自我</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3889">64:49</a>&nbsp;原谅我一生放荡不羁爱罐头</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5388">89:48</a>&nbsp;GTA玩家又怎么会轻易破防呢！？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6002">100:02</a>&nbsp;最过誉的——！罗斯特大战“神秘嘉宾”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6574">109:34</a>&nbsp;第一轮结束，中场休息环节</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6643">110:43</a>&nbsp;最后生还者2居然成为他的心头好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7963">132:43</a>&nbsp;用真心就可以吗！？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8029">133:49</a>&nbsp;我打DOTA和CS能打很久！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8662">144:22</a>&nbsp;突然发现，我滚刀就完了呗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9000">150:00</a>&nbsp;他很直接地对我进行了人身攻击</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9156">152:36</a>&nbsp;最终之战，自刎归天！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10502">175:02</a>&nbsp;我只是找回了我的重甲！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11147">185:47</a>&nbsp;最终比分，火力少年王竟是他！？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6344c676e152449a3edb9f0c/lqJOLpTgS7rUNzf83UBhjuGqJ8Qz.m4a" length="183541382" type="audio/mp4"/>
