    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab376d193d5eb3bdc79b192</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《鬼武者：剑之道》战斗和配音夯爆了，但是！ | 走神大师226</span></p><p><span>参与者：修理、Lost、化身伊陆</span></p><p><span>OP：うぬぼれ刑事のテーマ〜2010</span></p><p><span>ED：鬼武者3 Ending曲</span></p><p><span>鬼武者复活后的第一作《鬼武者：剑之道》终于发售了！走神大师们带着各自的通关体验、独特的专业视角，结合旧作与躺枪的其它优秀作品，带你走近本作鲜明的优缺点。</span></p><p><span>节目内容可能引起爆笑，请谨慎收听。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 符合直觉的战斗爽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 演都不演的通马桶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> 看似割裂，实则自洽？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2877">47:57</a> 红魂的事居然让阿罗和修理打起来了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3263">54:23</a> 聊演出！专业视角解析配音为何这么棒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3794">63:14</a> “角色塑造优先于剧情质量”的商法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4223">70:23</a> 动画版吐槽：同样是宫本武藏，差距真的很大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4497">74:57</a> 【剧透预警】本作的反派塑造令人难忘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4794">79:54</a> 聊到剧情，别的游戏开始躺枪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5377">89:37</a> 基础的功能拉完了，镜头视角疯狂背刺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5570">92:50</a> 印象深刻的BOSS战！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6775">112:55</a> 令人惊呼“少玩几块钱”的小技巧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6885">114:45</a> 从幻魔形象聊起：旧作的“时髦感”荡然无存</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7818">130:18</a> 鬼武者变身：总是忘记用大招</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8050">134:10</a> “想什么呢？这可是卡普空啊。”</span></p>]]></description>
